Vermont QSO Party -- the 14 Vermont counties, each its own multiplier.
Three-letter codes from the sponsor's 2027 rules, section 7(B)(c) (docs/ContestRules/QSOParties/Vermont/vtqso.md, dated 30-OCT-2026); the same 14 codes as DXLog.net's VTQP.txt.
No county maps to the state: the rules count the 14 Vermont counties as multipliers of their own for every entrant.
No INCLUDE here: an out-of-state entrant's table holds only the counties (the host-area rule reads it).
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

ADD = ADD,^Addison
BEN = BEN,^Bennington
CAL = CAL,^Caledonia
CHI = CHI,^Chittenden
ESS = ESS,^Essex
FRA = FRA,^Franklin
GRA = GRA,^Grand Isle
LAM = LAM,^Lamoille
ORA = ORA,^Orange
ORL = ORL,^Orleans
RUT = RUT,^Rutland
WAS = WAS,^Washington
WNH = WNH,^Windham
WNS = WNS,^Windsor
